: 'calculate_torque', 'arguments': '{"force": 2202, "lever_arm": 0.1}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '220.20000000000002', 'tool_call_id': 'fc_0f9edc54-c9da-40f9-8099-b158ca4e7c0e'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '**Total lifting force**\n\nThe required lifting force must overcome both the weight of the mass and provide the upward acceleration:\n\n\\[\nF = m\\,(g + a)= 200\\;\\text{kg}\\,(9.81 + 1.2)\\;\\text{m/s}^2 = 200 \\times 11.01 = \\mathbf{2.20\\times10^{3}\\;N}\n\\]\n\n**Torque on the drum shaft**\n\nTorque is the product of the force and the drum radius (force is assumed to act tangentially, so \\(\\sin 90^\\circ = 1\\)):\n\n\\[\n\\tau = r\\,F = 0.1\\;\\text{m}\\times 2202\\;\\text{N}= \\mathbf{2.20\\times10^{2}\\;N\\!\\cdot\\!m}\n\\]\n\nSo, the winch must apply a lifting force of **≈\u202f2.20\u202fkN** and a torque of **≈\u202f220\u202fN·m** on the drum shaft.'}], 'model': 'openai/gpt-oss-120b', 'n': 1, 'reasoning_effort': None, 'reasoning_format': None, 'response_format': {'type': 'json_object'}, 'service_tier': 'on_demand', 'stop': None, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.7}}
